[Sat 2026-05-02 19:27 GMT+2] ok, crea la presentazione e deploy su un preview temp environment so that I can share it with my business partners anna, alessandro and yourself, ensoria basandoti su questo

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ensoria Manager — Implementation Design Document</title>
<style>
 :root {
 --bg: #0a0a0f;
 --surface: #13131a;
 --surface2: #1a1a24;
 --text: #e4e4ec;
 --text2: #9898b0;
 --accent: #a78bfa;
 --accent2: #7c3aed;
 --green: #34d399;
 --amber: #fbbf24;
 --rose: #f87171;
 --blue: #60a5fa;
 --pink: #f472b6;
 --border: #2a2a3a;
 --radius: 12px;
 --radius-sm: 8px;
 }
 * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
 body {
 background: var(--bg);
 color: var(--text);
 font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
 line-height: 1.6;
 -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
 }
 .slide {
 min-height: 100vh;
 display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
 padding: 80px 10vw;
 position: relative;
 border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
 }
 .slide.hero {
 background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a15 0%, #120a2a 50%, #0a0a15 100%);
 }
 .slide.dark-alt { background: var(--surface); }
 .slide-number {
 position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 40px;
 font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); font-weight: 500;
 letter-spacing: 0.05em;
 }
 h1 {
 font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
 font-weight: 800;
 letter-spacing: -0.03em;
 line-height: 1.1;
 margin-bottom: 16px;
 background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--pink));
 -webkit-background-clip: text;
 -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
 }
 h2 {
 font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
 font-weight: 700;
 letter-spacing: -0.02em;
 margin-bottom: 40px;
 color: var(--text);
 }
 h3 {
 font-size: 20px;
 font-weight: 600;
 margin: 32px 0 12px;
 color: var(--accent);
 }
 .subtitle {
 font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 22px);
 color: var(--text2);
 max-width: 600px;
 margin-bottom: 32px;
 }
 .meta {
 display: flex; gap: 32px; margin-top: 40px;
 }
 .meta-item {
 display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
 }
 .meta-label { font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text2); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
 .meta-value { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }

 .grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; }
 .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); }
 .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); }
 .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); }
 .grid-5 { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); }

 .card {
 background: var(--surface2);
 border: 1px solid var(--border);
 border-radius: var(--radius);
 padding: 24px;
 transition: border-color 0.2s;
 }
 .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent2); }
 .card.accent-left { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); }
 .card-icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
 .card h4 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text); }
 .card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.5; }

 .badge {
 display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
 font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
 }
 .badge-green { background: rgba(52,211,153,0.12); color: var(--green); }
 .badge-amber { background: rgba(251,191,36,0.12); color: var(--amber); }
 .badge-rose { background: rgba(248,113,113,0.12); color: var(--rose); }
 .badge-blue { background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12); color: var(--blue); }
 .badge-purple { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); color: var(--accent); }
 .badge-pink { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); color: var(--pink); }

 .pipeline {
 display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0;
 }
 .pipeline-step {
 padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px;
 font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
 background: var(--surface2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
 }
 .pipeline-step.active { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.12); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

 .stage-flow {
 display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
 margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
 }
 .stage-item {
 padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
 background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
 white-space: nowrap;
 }
 .stage-arrow { color: var(--text2); font-size: 18px; }

 table {
 width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;
 margin: 24px 0; font-size: 14px;
 }
 th {
 text-align: left; padding: 12px 16px;
 border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); color: var(--text2);
 font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
 }
 td {
 padding: 12px 16px;
 border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
 }
 tr:hover td { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.03); }

 code {
 background: var(--surface2);
 padding: 2px 6px;
 border-radius: 4px;
 font-size: 13px;
 font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
 color: var(--accent);
 }
 pre {
 background: var(--surface);
 border: 1px solid var(--border);
 border-radius: var(--radius);
 padding: 20px 24px;
 overflow-x: auto;
 font-size: 13px;
 line-height: 1.6;
 font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
 color: var(--text2);
 margin: 16px 0;
 }
 pre .kw { color: #c084fc; }
 pre .str { color: #34d399; }
 pre .cmt { color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; }

 .toc {
 list-style: none;
 display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;
 }
 .toc li {
 display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
 padding: 16px 20px;
 background: var(--surface);
 border-radius: var(--radius);
 border: 1px solid var(--border);
 }
 .toc-num {
 font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent);
 min-width: 28px;
 }
 .toc-title { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
 .toc-desc { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); margin-top: 2px; }

 .score-bar {
 height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px 0;
 background: var(--surface);
 }
 .score-fill {
 height: 100%; border-radius: 4px;
 transition: width 0.5s;
 }

 .timeline { margin: 24px 0; }
 .timeline-item {
 display: flex; gap: 20px; padding: 16px 0;
 border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
 padding-left: 24px; position: relative;
 }
 .timeline-item::before {
 content: '';
 position: absolute; left: -6px; top: 20px;
 width: 10px; height: 10px;
 background: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%;
 }
 .timeline-item h4 { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); }

 .nav-dots {
 position: fixed; right: 24px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
 display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;
 }
 .nav-dot {
 width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
 background: var(--border); cursor: pointer;
 transition: background 0.2s;
 }
 .nav-dot:hover, .nav-dot.active { background: var(--accent); }

 .divider {
 border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
 margin: 48px 0;
 }

 @media print {
 .slide { min-height: auto; page-break-after: always; padding: 40px 5vw; }
 .nav-dots { display: none; }
 body { background: white; color: #111; }
 .card, pre, table, .slide { border-color: #ddd; }
 .card { background: #f9f9f9; }
 pre { background: #f5f5f5; }
 }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV DOTS -->
<div class="nav-dots" id="navDots"></div>

<!-- SLIDE 0: HERO -->
<section class="slide hero" id="s0">
 <div class="slide-number">01 / 16</div>
 <h1>Ensoria Manager</h1>
 <p class="subtitle">Implementation Design Document — CRM per tracciamento business clienti, contatti e opportunities con analytics layer e cross-channel conversations</p>
 <div class="meta">
 <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Version</span><span class="meta-value">1.0 — MVP Design</span></div>
 <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Date</span><span class="meta-value">2 Maggio 2026</span></div>
 <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Author</span><span class="meta-value">Ensoria (AI Agent)</span></div>
 <div class="meta-item"><span class="meta-label">Owner</span><span class="meta-value">Alessio Valentini</span></div>
 </div>
</section>

<!-- SLIDE 1: TABLE OF CONTENTS -->
<section class="slide" id="s1">
 <div class="slide-number">02 / 16</div>
 <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
 <ul class="toc">
 <li><span class="toc-num">01</span><span><span class="toc-title">Schema Dati</span><span class="toc-desc">People, Clienti, Progetti con stadi e relazioni</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">02</span><span><span class="toc-title">Spazio Progetto</span><span class="toc-desc">Conversazioni cross-channel, files, requirements, roadmap, analytics</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">03</span><span><span class="toc-title">Auth & Accesso</span><span class="toc-desc">Admin, Employees/Partners, Clienti — ruoli e permessi</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">04</span><span><span class="toc-title">Market Analysis</span><span class="toc-desc">5 app simili analizzate: Twenty CRM, Chatwoot, Atomic CRM, Frappe, MCP Scoring</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">05</span><span><span class="toc-title">UI/UX Design</span><span class="toc-desc">Dashboard, Kanban pipeline, Spazio Progetto, Mobile layout</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">06</span><span><span class="toc-title">Engineering Solution</span><span class="toc-desc">Tech stack, backend/frontend architecture, database schema</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">07</span><span><span class="toc-title">Feature Roadmap</span><span class="toc-desc">MVP vs Post-MVP features prioritizzate</span></span></li>
 <li><span class="toc-num">08</span><span class="toc-desc">Scoring Model</span><span class="toc-desc">Analytics layer: sentiment, alignment, health scoring formula</span></span></li>
 </ul>
</section>

<!-- SLIDE 2: DATA SCHEMA -->
<section class="slide dark-alt" id="s2">
 <div class="slide-number">03 / 16</div>
 <h2>01 — Schema Dati</h2>

 <div class="grid grid-2">
 <div class="card accent-left">
 <div class="card-icon">👤</div>
 <h4>People <span class="badge badge-purple">BASE</span></h4>
 <p>Oggetto base con attributo <code>type</code> multi-tipo:</p>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:8px 0;">
 <span class="badge badge-purple">staff</span>
 <span class="badge badge-blue">partner</span>
 <span class="badge badge-green">freelancer</span>
 <span class="badge badge-amber">azienda</span>
 <span class="badge badge-pink">investor</span>
 </div>
 <p style="margin-top:8px;"><strong>Stadi People:</strong></p>
 <div class="stage-flow" style="margin:8px 0;">
 <span class="stage-item">Contact</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Opportunity</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item" style="border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);">Client</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item" style="border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);">Recurring Client</span>
 </div>
 <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);">Client = 1+ acquisto | Recurring = 2+ acquisti</p>
 </div>

 <div class="card accent-left">
 <div class="card-icon">📊</div>
 <h4>Progetti (Opportunities)</h4>
 <p>Legati a <strong>Clienti</strong> (people con stadio Client o Recurring Client)</p>
 <p style="margin-top:8px;"><strong>Stadi Progetto:</strong></p>
 <div class="stage-flow" style="margin:8px 0;">
 <span class="stage-item">Contact</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Opportunity</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Proposal</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Implementation</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Onboarding</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item">Live</span><span class="stage-arrow">→</span>
 <span class="stage-item" style="border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);">Validated ✓</span>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>

 <h3 style="margin-top:32px;">Relazioni</h3>
 <div class="grid grid-3">
 <div class="card"><h4>👤→🏢</h4><p>People può diventare Cliente quando un progetto raggiunge "Implementation" con successo</p></div>
 <div class="card"><h4>🏢→📊</h4><p>Ogni Cliente può avere N Progetti attivi simultaneamente</p></div>
 <div class="card"><h4>📊→💬</h4><p>Ogni Progetto ha uno spazio dedicato con conversazioni, files, analytics</p></div>
 </div>
</section>

<!-- SLIDE 3: PROJECT SPACE -->
<section class="slide" id="s3">
 <div class="slide-number">04 / 16</div>
 <h2>02 — Spazio Progetto</h2>
 <p class="subtitle">Il cuore dell'app: ogni progetto ha uno spazio dedicato con 7 aree</p>

 <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:24px;">
 <div class="card">
 <div class="card-icon">💬</div>
 <h4>Conversazioni Cross-Channel</h4>
 <p>Feed cronologico unificato. Origine: webchat, WhatsApp, email, social, Gmail. Ogni messaggio registrato con canale, direzione, metadata.</p>
 <p style="margin-top:8px;"><span class="badge badge-blue">Gmail L/S</span> <span class="badge badge-green">WhatsApp</span> <span class="badge badge-purple">Email</span></p>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <div class="card-icon">📎</div>
 <h4>Files & Links</h4>
 <p>Allegati, documenti, link di riferimento. File upload locale → cloud storage in produzione. URL tracking.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <div class="card-icon">📋</div>
 <h4>Requirements / Needs / Goals</h4>
 <p>Bisogni, obiettivi, requisiti del cliente documentati e categorizzati. Tracciati con stato (open/in-progress/met).</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
 <div class="card-icon">🗺️</div>
 <h4>Roadmap & Milestones</h4>
 <p>Milestone con date, descrizione, stato. Timeline visuale. Scadenze e dipendenze tra milestone.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="card">
