 <div class="card accent-left" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
 <h4>📐 Formula Composita</h4>
 <p style="font-size:18px;font-family:monospace;color:var(--accent);margin:12px 0;">
 Health Score = Sentiment(30%) + Alignment(25%) + Progress(20%) + Engagement(15%) + Volume(10%)
 </p>
